.TH GIT-REVIEW 1
.SH NAME
git-review \- open Git Viewer for the current working tree
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B git review
.RI [ BASE ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add or select the working tree containing the current directory in Git Viewer's
repository sidebar, and bring the window to the front. The review shows the
merge base, selected head, and any changes from that head's worktree.
.PP
With
.IR BASE ,
set the saved comparison base for this repository. The default tries
.BR origin/HEAD ,
.BR main ,
then
.BR master .
